  _glyph: "\U0001F436\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Dorothy's little black dog
  _description: A small black dog with long silky hair and merry little eyes. He
    keeps [[397fd117-a8f8-4702-a3f6-36373425de00|Dorothy Gale]] from being sad, and
    at the end it is Toto who knocks over the screen that hides [[c06656b6-d555-4649-8f9a-90f3906eafc3|Oz,
    the Great and Terrible]].
